(zn)
the manner of preferring an appeal to the Commission for grant of recognition under sub-section (5) of section 35;
(zo)
the manner of including a medical qualification in the list maintained by the Board under sub-section (6) of section 35;
(zp)
the manner in which the Board of Ayurveda or the Board of Unani, Siddha and Sowa-Rigpa shall list and maintain the
medical qualifications which have been granted recognition before the date of commencement of this Act, under
sub-section (8) of section 35;
